<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan to host SAARC seminar on ports, shipping.</title>
<headline>Pakistan to host SAARC seminar on ports, shipping.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan will host a two-day seminar on ports and shipping for the seven-nation South Asian Association for Regional Cooperation (SAARC) in Karachi from December 10, a spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The seminar is expected to benefit government officials, port managers, shipping companies, forwarders, shippers and businessmen in general,&quot; said the spokesman for the Master Mariners Society of Pakistan.</p>
<p>SAARC groups India, Pakistan, Bangladesh, Sri Lanka, Nepal, Bhutan and the Maldives.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
